
<div class="bg-secondary-subtle p-3 m-4" >
    <h1 >Student Feedback Form</h1>
    <h4 >Please give us your honest feedback about the class! You can do this anonymously!</h4>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-5" id="instructions">
        <h2>Instructions</h2>
        <p>As one of our students, your thoughts and feedback are important</p>
        <p>Please send them using this form</p>
        <p>If you would like us to follow up with you, provide your contact information</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="col-md-7">
    <form action="/submit-feedback"  method="POST">
        <label class="form-label" for="name">Enter your name:</label>
        <input class="form-control" id="name" name="name">
        <br>

        <label class="form-label" for="email">Enter in your email:</label>
        <input class="form-control" id="email" type="email" name="email">
        <br>

        <label class="form-label" for="comments">Comments</label>
        <textarea class="form-control" id="comments" name="comments" required></textarea>
        <br>

        <p class="mx-2">Are you a current student?</p>

        <div class="form-check">
            <input class="form-check-input" id="yes" type="radio" value="yes" name="current-student">
            <label class="form-check-label" for="yes" >Yes</label>
        </div>

        <div class="form-check">
            <input class="form-check-input" id="no" type="radio" value="no" name="current-student">
            <label class="form-check-label" for="no">No</label>
        </div>
        <br>

        <input class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">
    </form>
</div>

